{"video_id": "FxDhfXkK5O4", "lang": "zh-Hant", "events": [{"type": "chat", "time": 0.0, "timestamp": "00:00:00", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hello hello 👋 see ya some time later 🤒 ... stay hydrated and take breaks"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2.23, "timestamp": "00:00:02", "text": "這是我唯一後悔的事，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4.789, "timestamp": "00:00:04", "text": "因為我忘了帶。它真的很"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15.03, "timestamp": "00:00:15", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18.07, "timestamp": "00:00:18", "text": "我能被聽見嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25.84, "timestamp": "00:00:25", "text": "M"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27.83, "timestamp": "00:00:27", "text": "（音樂）"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 31.349, "timestamp": "00:00:31", "text": "給我一分鐘時間。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 42.63, "timestamp": "00:00:42", "text": "好的。我在這裡。我正在直播。嘿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 45.27, "timestamp": "00:00:45", "text": "大家好。希望你們一切都好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 53.99, "timestamp": "00:00:53", "text": "我的東西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 56.549, "timestamp": "00:00:56", "text": "不是填充物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 59.67, "timestamp": "00:00:59", "text": "我查過了。我或許可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 64.63, "timestamp": "00:01:04", "text": "解決這個問題。我似乎在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 73.99, "timestamp": "00:01:13", "text": "好了。問題解決了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 77.35, "timestamp": "00:01:17", "text": "好了，問題解決了。耶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 81.35, "timestamp": "00:01:21", "text": "大家好。非常抱歉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 85.429, "timestamp": "00:01:25", "text": "這麼晚還在直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 87.91, "timestamp": "00:01:27", "text": "嗯，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 98.8, "timestamp": "00:01:38", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "👋"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 101.106, "timestamp": "00:01:41", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! Aniket W~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 101.99000000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:41", "text": "我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 106.913, "timestamp": "00:01:46", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ-r4KpS3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 110.22999999999999, "timestamp": "00:01:50", "text": "睡著了。呃，我當時在看《嗜血法醫："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 114.469, "timestamp": "00:01:54", "text": "復活》第一季。嗯，我當時正在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 116.95, "timestamp": "00:01:56", "text": "看那個。我當時想，我看完"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 119.27000000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:59", "text": "第四集，休息一會兒，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 123.03, "timestamp": "00:02:03", "text": "吃點東西，回來，呃，直播，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 126.069, "timestamp": "00:02:06", "text": "然後再睡一會兒。但我真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 128.63, "timestamp": "00:02:08", "text": "睡著了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 133.19, "timestamp": "00:02:13", "text": "所以，我還是希望這140天，也就是140天，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 136.71, "timestamp": "00:02:16", "text": "還是會算是140天。我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 139.19, "timestamp": "00:02:19", "text": "昨天，我知道是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 143.11, "timestamp": "00:02:23", "text": "第二天。我知道現在已經過了12點"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 146.47, "timestamp": "00:02:26", "text": "，但我凌晨1點就醒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 149.35, "timestamp": "00:02:29", "text": "真的是凌晨1點整。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 151.35, "timestamp": "00:02:31", "text": "所以，老實說，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 153.43, "timestamp": "00:02:33", "text": "我本來想早上直播的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 155.35, "timestamp": "00:02:35", "text": "。我當時正在編寫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 159.27, "timestamp": "00:02:39", "text": "小部件的HTML疊加層。正如你在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 163.67000000000002, "timestamp": "00:02:43", "text": "螢幕上看到的，直播功能又回來了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 166.63, "timestamp": "00:02:46", "text": "天哪，我為此付出了很多心血。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 169.35, "timestamp": "00:02:49", "text": "說實話，當時真是忙得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 173.03, "timestamp": "00:02:53", "text": "不可開交。我感覺"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 175.19, "timestamp": "00:02:55", "text": "筋疲力盡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 178.949, "timestamp": "00:02:58", "text": "我感覺筋疲力盡。我當時想，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 182.07, "timestamp": "00:03:02", "text": "人生到此為止了。  情況就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 186.309, "timestamp": "00:03:06", "text": "那麼糟。說實話，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 187.52, "timestamp": "00:03:07", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 189.35, "timestamp": "00:03:09", "text": "[音樂] 也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 192.22899999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:12", "text": "太累了。  是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 196.47, "timestamp": "00:03:16", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 210.39, "timestamp": "00:03:30", "text": "呃，讓我拿一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 213.50900000000001, "timestamp": "00:03:33", "text": "這個，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 216.22899999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:36", "text": "然後更新頻道。嗯，標題再說一次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 218.789, "timestamp": "00:03:38", "text": "我需要研究一下動態流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 221.82999999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:41", "text": "標題的相關問題。說實話，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 228.149, "timestamp": "00:03:48", "text": "有時候它沒能正確地取得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 235.43, "timestamp": "00:03:55", "text": "顯然，我當時正在運行 Twitch 和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 237.82999999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:57", "text": "kickboard 接力賽，但 Twitch"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 241.67, "timestamp": "00:04:01", "text": "直播不知何故突然中斷了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 243.429, "timestamp": "00:04:03", "text": "此時此刻，我覺得我應該"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 246.949, "timestamp": "00:04:06", "text": "完全改用 Mel"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 250.07, "timestamp": "00:04:10", "text": "多重融合。  我用的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 253.11, "timestamp": "00:04:13", "text": "多平台直播，但我現在還在用Beam，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 257.27, "timestamp": "00:04:17", "text": "因為Beam也有問題，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 260.39, "timestamp": "00:04:20", "text": "Kick倒是沒問題。 Kick 和 Beam 自己的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 262.71, "timestamp": "00:04:22", "text": "平台就很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 265.189, "timestamp": "00:04:25", "text": "但是 Twitch，唉，Twitch 和 YouTube"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 267.59, "timestamp": "00:04:27", "text": "總是會出問題。它斷了。它會"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 269.59, "timestamp": "00:04:29", "text": "時不時隨機斷電。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 272.15, "timestamp": "00:04:32", "text": "的，今天的直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 275.83, "timestamp": "00:04:35", "text": "對我來說只是聊天直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 278.87, "timestamp": "00:04:38", "text": "我猜他只是閒聊了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 282.31, "timestamp": "00:04:42", "text": "一會兒。實際上，這嚴格來說會持續1小時"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 289.749, "timestamp": "00:04:49", "text": "，時間嚴格限制在1小時以內。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 292.31, "timestamp": "00:04:52", "text": "我今晚就告辭了。今晚……呃，今天早上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 301.11, "timestamp": "00:05:01", "text": "我得去晨練。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 305.749, "timestamp": "00:05:05", "text": "我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 307.43, "timestamp": "00:05:07", "text": "鄰居"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 311.43, "timestamp": "00:05:11", "text": "兼老同學，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 315.67, "timestamp": "00:05:15", "text": "問他要不要一起出去玩，他還邀我去他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 317.749, "timestamp": "00:05:17", "text": "家甚麼的，我說不了，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 321.35, "timestamp": "00:05:21", "text": "不想去，因為我晚上已經有很多事要做了，結果又"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 328.95, "timestamp": "00:05:28", "text": "睡著了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 333.71, "timestamp": "00:05:33", "text": "但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 336.31, "timestamp": "00:05:36", "text": "（音樂）……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 340.79, "timestamp": "00:05:40", "text": "所以我就說，是我先"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 343.67, "timestamp": "00:05:43", "text": "提起的，真是蠢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 346.23, "timestamp": "00:05:46", "text": "也許我們可以像往常一樣，做我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 350.15, "timestamp": "00:05:50", "text": "日常的事情。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 353.43, "timestamp": "00:05:53", "text": "不該那麼說的。說"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 358.95, "timestamp": "00:05:58", "text": "實話，我並不介意散步，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 361.27, "timestamp": "00:06:01", "text": "但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 365.59, "timestamp": "00:06:05", "text": "以我的作息時間，我非常懷疑我能不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 369.11, "timestamp": "00:06:09", "text": "好好散步，因為我睡得不規律，起得也不規律，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 370.275, "timestamp": "00:06:10", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "when did u sleep to get up at 1 AM haha"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 383.43, "timestamp": "00:06:23", "text": "睡覺起床。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 387.029, "timestamp": "00:06:27", "text": "問得好。我大概在晚上7點到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 400.469, "timestamp": "00:06:40", "text": "所以，不知道。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 404.30899999999997, "timestamp": "00:06:44", "text": "最近我常常凌晨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 407.99, "timestamp": "00:06:47", "text": "三四點就醒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 411.11, "timestamp": "00:06:51", "text": "然後我就會在樓下玩手機，一邊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 419.189, "timestamp": "00:06:59", "text": "吃東西一邊玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 421.67, "timestamp": "00:07:01", "text": "。我可能會透過看影片"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 424.39, "timestamp": "00:07:04", "text": "來重新獲得靈感。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 426.55, "timestamp": "00:07:06", "text": "然後我就會想，是啊，我得起來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 431.029, "timestamp": "00:07:11", "text": "泡杯茶了。我起床了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 434.39, "timestamp": "00:07:14", "text": "直接上樓"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 442.95, "timestamp": "00:07:22", "text": "我開始工作，然後就忘了時間，完全"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 447.99, "timestamp": "00:07:27", "text": "沉浸其中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 451.749, "timestamp": "00:07:31", "text": "昨天早上就發生了這件事。我從凌晨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 456.629, "timestamp": "00:07:36", "text": "2 點起床後，一直沉浸其中，直到凌晨 4 點。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 459.43, "timestamp": "00:07:39", "text": "我昨天也是差不多這個時候醒來的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 461.83, "timestamp": "00:07:41", "text": "哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 463.909, "timestamp": "00:07:43", "text": "哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 468.95, "timestamp": "00:07:48", "text": "哦，是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 470.71, "timestamp": "00:07:50", "text": "不過昨天我下午"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 475.029, "timestamp": "00:07:55", "text": "5點6點就睡了。正確的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 479.189, "timestamp": "00:07:59", "text": "我完成了12小時6分鐘的學時。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 482.71, "timestamp": "00:08:02", "text": "哦，對，我就是這麼做的。然後我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 486.79, "timestamp": "00:08:06", "text": "四、五點鐘的時候開始用電腦，在三星手機上研究"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 492.79, "timestamp": "00:08:12", "text": "本地伺服器、WebSocket 伺服器和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 499.189, "timestamp": "00:08:19", "text": "是啊，當時真是忙得不可開交。然後我突然想到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 503.35, "timestamp": "00:08:23", "text": "一個主意。為什麼我不建立一個監聽器，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 506.469, "timestamp": "00:08:26", "text": "像伺服器設定本機 WebSocket 相關"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 509.83, "timestamp": "00:08:29", "text": "內容一樣，這樣我就可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 512.31, "timestamp": "00:08:32", "text": "單獨監聽它以及其他四個元素，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 516.07, "timestamp": "00:08:36", "text": "例如即時狀態、串流主題"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 519.67, "timestamp": "00:08:39", "text": "狀態和活動狀態。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 523.269, "timestamp": "00:08:43", "text": "他們三個。現在我只能根據"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 530.389, "timestamp": "00:08:50", "text": "接收到的資料進行視覺更新，而且這確實有效。然後我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 532.79, "timestamp": "00:08:52", "text": "意識到，哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 534.31, "timestamp": "00:08:54", "text": "這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 537.03, "timestamp": "00:08:57", "text": "東西在控制台裡有很多日誌，導致程式運行卡頓，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 547.03, "timestamp": "00:09:07", "text": "我關閉了偵錯模式。天哪，Chad GPT"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 551.509, "timestamp": "00:09:11", "text": "真是個麻煩。說實話，兄弟，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 554.47, "timestamp": "00:09:14", "text": "查德·GP，這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 568.71, "timestamp": "00:09:28", "text": "這就像一對相愛相殺的關係。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 578.55, "timestamp": "00:09:38", "text": "就像我之前做網站的時候，像是資料輸入之類的，所有需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 584.389, "timestamp": "00:09:44", "text": "輸入的資料都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 593.11, "timestamp": "00:09:53", "text": "一個提示產生的，只需要"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 594.556, "timestamp": "00:09:54", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "u remember me saying i was visiting doctor yestrday ? i visited neurologist she said i have nerve damage due to eye-stress and dehydration... i have done brain MRI and hoping it isn't anything serious"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 595.67, "timestamp": "00:09:55", "text": "一個回覆就能填完所有需要的資訊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 600.87, "timestamp": "00:10:00", "text": "但是免費版在處理程式碼"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 601.771, "timestamp": "00:10:01", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "TAKE CARE OF UR HEALTH BUDDY ... GET ENOUGH SLEEP WHENEVER YOU CAN"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 603.829, "timestamp": "00:10:03", "text": "相關的事情時就很糟糕，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 609.67, "timestamp": "00:10:09", "text": "程式碼一直在改變等等。我覺得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 611.75, "timestamp": "00:10:11", "text": "昨天我就是因為"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 614.23, "timestamp": "00:10:14", "text": "這樣而感到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 620.81, "timestamp": "00:10:20", "text": "很沮喪。  是啊，我當時真是受夠了。我覺得渾身都燒焦了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 623.19, "timestamp": "00:10:23", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 625.269, "timestamp": "00:10:25", "text": "但說實話，我覺得又到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 628.15, "timestamp": "00:10:28", "text": "每個月的那個時候了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 657.509, "timestamp": "00:10:57", "text": "。另外，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 676.949, "timestamp": "00:11:16", "text": "我的銀行帳戶也已準備就緒。  這個名字字面意思就是「jocknick」（運動健將）。兄弟，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 707.829, "timestamp": "00:11:47", "text": "。  我的天哪，我太高興了。  我的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 708.423, "timestamp": "00:11:48", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "QR CODE is better than Google"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 715.67, "timestamp": "00:11:55", "text": "日曆卡已準備"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 718.389, "timestamp": "00:11:58", "text": "就緒。我只需要設定一個"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 719.878, "timestamp": "00:11:59", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "*youtube not google"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time":